<title>HONG KONG: Kowloon Dev 1996 net jumps 175 percent.</title>
<headline>Kowloon Dev 1996 net jumps 175 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   52.9	 vs 19.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    15.0	 vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  51.98 gain vs 11.99 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    255.72     vs 92.97</p>
<p>    Turnover		     351.71     vs 210.06</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kowloon Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 3-11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Kowloon Development is a Property investment group which also operates cinemas and other film-related businesses.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of fixed assets.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 22 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of seven cents) vs 15 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
